 LinearLayout bookRow(Store.Book b,String status){LinearLayout r=row();r.setPadding(dp(12),dp(8),dp(12),dp(8));r.setBackground(box(Color.WHITE,0xFFE2DED8));ImageView cover=new ImageView(this);cover.setScaleType(ImageView.ScaleType.FIT_CENTER);cover.setBackgroundColor(0xFFF0ECE5);cover.setContentDescription("Portada de "+b.title);r.addView(cover,new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(dp(72),dp(98)));LinearLayout text=column();TextView t=label(b.title,22,INK);t.setTypeface(null,Typeface.BOLD);text.addView(t);text.addView(label(b.author.isEmpty()?"Autor no indicado":b.author,17,MUTED));text.addView(label(status+" · "+store.categoryName(b.category),14,RED));r.addView(text,new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(0,-2,1));TextView arrow=label("Abrir  ›",19,RED);r.addView(arrow);String key=b.uri+"@"+b.modified;cover.setTag(key);Bitmap cached=coverCache.get(key);if(cached!=null)cover.setImageBitmap(cached);else{int token=generation;covers.execute(()->{if(token!=generation||isDestroyed())return;Bitmap bmp=null;try(PdfSession p=new PdfSession(this,b.uri)){bmp=p.render(0,144);}catch(Exception|OutOfMemoryError ignored){}final Bitmap result=bmp;ui.post(()->{if(isDestroyed())return;if(result!=null){coverCache.put(key,result);if(token==generation&&key.equals(cover.getTag()))cover.setImageBitmap(result);}});});}return r;}
